<title>ITALY: RALLYING - LEADING POSITIONS AFTER SECOND DAY OF SAN REMO RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING - LEADING POSITIONS AFTER SECOND DAY OF SAN REMO RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>LA ROSA, Italy 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after</p>
<p>the second day of the San Remo rally on Tuesday:</p>
<p> 1. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza   2 hours 49 minutes 42</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p> 2. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford Escort Cosworth  32 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza		  36</p>
<p> 4. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza	   54</p>
<p> 5. Bruno Thiry (Belgium) Ford Escort Cosworth     1:00</p>
<p> 6. Franco Cunico (Italy) Ford Escort Cosworth     2:39</p>
<p> 7. Gilberto Pianezzola (Italy) Toyota Celica GT4  2.53</p>
<p> 8. Freddie Loix (Belgium) Toyota Celica GT4	 3.14</p>
<p> 9. Didier Auriol (France) Mitsubishi Lancer	 3.15</p>
<p> 10. Angelo Medeghini (Italy) Subaru Impreza	 4.19</p>
</text>
